{"steamAppId":3648240,"description":"The Battle for Burgers Begins\n【Synopsis】\nA cheerful man excitedly arrives at a popular burger shop in town. However, it turns out to be a terrifying facility controlled by the evil Emperor \"Pattypatine\"! Ravenous, rampaging burgers are everywhere... Fight back with the shining fries, the \"Potato Saber\"!\nFight with Potatoes\nWield your Potato Saber and slice through evil! Master parrying and dodging to navigate battles skillfully.You can eat when you're hungry. Get ready for intense, greasy-handed combat!\nUse the Moos\nMoos: The power residing in all objects. Use it to pull or lift distant items to solve puzzles! Is it faster to just use your hands? ...\nAn Emotional Story\nAs you progress, mysteries unfold, and the protagonist's past is revealed. What kind of ending awaits? This game is designed for 1-2 hours of playtime. The story is self-contained with no branching paths.\nRegarding Videos and Streaming\nPlaythrough videos and streaming are welcome. Please confirm the following two points:\nPlease include the game's name in the title (required).\n\nPlease include the Steam store page URL in the description (optional).","short_description":"A cheerful man excitedly arrives at a popular burger shop in town. However, it turns out to be a terrifying facility controlled by the evil Emperor \"Pattypatine\"! Ravenous, rampaging burgers are everywhere... Fight back with the shining fries, the \"Potato Saber\"!","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648240/1a9ecee753c5476411515395a900a0ff0acebf25/header.jpg?t=1754416405","developer":"lemorion_1224","publisher":"lemorion_1224","genre":"Экшены, Приключенческие игры","platforms":["Windows"],"modes":["Один игрок"],"playerCount":0,"releaseLabel":"5 авг. 2025 г.","comingSoon":false,"metacritic":null,"metacriticUrl":null,"steam":99,"steamReviewCount":70,"screenshots":[{"id":0,"image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/ste